BEGIN_PGML Use the graphs of trigonometric functions to find the following information.
(a) [`\cos 0 = `] [_]{$ans1}{6}
(b) [`\tan \pi = `] [_]{$ans2}{6}
(c) All values of [`x`] in the interval [`[-2\pi, 2\pi]`] where [`\sin x = -1\text{.}`] List your answers from smallest to largest. If there are only three such values (for example) then write `none' in any remaining answer boxes. [_]{$ans3}{6} and [_]{$ans4}{6} and [_]{$ans5}{6} and [_]{$ans5}{6}
